&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;v3 backend: &lt;a href="https://github.com/marusyaganza/language-power-api" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;language-power-api&lt;/a&gt;, with its &lt;a href="https://github.com/marusyaganza/language-power-api/blob/main/docs/architecture.png" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;architecture diagram&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
