&lt;h2 class="heading-element"&gt;⚡ What is OrderCraft?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OrderCraft&lt;/strong&gt; is a 100% original, permissive open-source financial charting workstation built from first principles with &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;React 19&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Lightweight Charts v5&lt;/strong&gt; (Apache-2.0).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designed for active discretionary traders, quantitative developers, and financial analysts, OrderCraft runs as a &lt;strong&gt;single standalone binary with an embedded high-speed frontend&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;//go:embed&lt;/code&gt;), a local &lt;strong&gt;Docker container&lt;/strong&gt;, or a &lt;strong&gt;PWA app&lt;/strong&gt;. It features sub-millisecond multi-exchange WebSocket streams, multi-chart synchronized workspaces, pixel-perfect drawing primitives, vectorized indicator math, and complete local SQLite persistence.&lt;/p&gt;

